	"web_text": "This fan's painted central scene shows a young couple playing music together; the man plucks the strings of a harp while the woman consults her sheet music. Cupid touches the woman's elbow while gesturing toward the heavens. A boy stands before the couple, seemingly conducting their performance. The inclusion of both French and Spanish texts—“La Joven Discipula Guiada Por Cupido” (“The young pupil guided by Cupid”) above and “La j[e]une Ecoliere guidé/ par l'amour” (“The young schoolgirl guided by love”) below—suggests that it may have been intended for export.",
	"didactic_label": "This fan's painted central scene shows a young couple playing music together; the man plucks the strings of a harp while the woman consults her sheet music. Cupid touches the woman's elbow while gesturing toward the heavens. A boy stands before the couple, seemingly conducting their performance. The inclusion of both French and Spanish texts—“La Joven Discipula Guiada Por Cupido” (“The young pupil guided by Cupid”) above and “La j[e]une Ecoliere guidé/ par l'amour” (“The young schoolgirl guided by love”) below—suggests that it may have been intended for export.",
